OL,3,GNEWSAFour youths charged in connection
OL,4,Awith Bonfire Night disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour youths have been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with disorder and
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour in Edinburgh on
OL,9,FBonfire Night.
OL,11,FPolice officers were targeted with
OL,12,Ffireworks while responding to calls
OL,13,Fthat Oxgangs Road North had been
OL,14,Fblockaded by the group at about 17:30.
OL,16,FNo-one was injured in the incident and
OL,17,Fa fire started in a large communal bin
OL,18,Fwas extinguished.
OL,20,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said
OL,21,Freports would be submitted to the
OL,22,Frelevant authorities.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
